	"description": "A page at 2:07 a.m.: orders go through, nobody gets an invoice, and nobody on call knows which of the three services sends invoices. A grep, a wrong guess, a judgmental cat, and then the canvas draws where the order actually goes: controller, service, the orders table, HTTP into billing (Python), Kafka into shipping. It does not find the bug; it shows where to look. Demo project (Harbor Goods). Real captures of Insilode, a code editor built on VS Code. Voice: synthetic (AI-generated). Music composed in code. Free and open source: insilode.dev",
